Claude Desktop (Settings → Connectors)Claude.ai (Settings → Integrations)Cursor <p>Remote MCP servers cannot be added to <code>claude_desktop_config.json</code>. Use the Connectors UI instead:</p> <ol> <li>Open Claude Desktop → Settings → Connectors</li> <li>Click Add connector</li> <li>Enter URL: <code>https://unified-crm-extension.labs.ringcentral.com/mcp</code></li> <li>Click Connect</li> <li>Authenticate with RingCentral when prompted</li> <li>Authenticate with your CRM when prompted</li> </ol> <ol> <li>Open Settings → Integrations → Add MCP Server</li> <li>Enter URL: <code>https://unified-crm-extension.labs.ringcentral.com/mcp</code></li> <li>Click Connect</li> <li>Authenticate with RingCentral when prompted</li> <li>Authenticate with your CRM when prompted</li> </ol> <pre><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "appconnect": {
      "url": "https://unified-crm-extension.labs.ringcentral.com/mcp",
      "type": "http"
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>

